<title>USA: Burlington Express upgrades internet servic.</title>
<headline>Burlington Express upgrades internet servic.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, California 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Burlington Air Express (BAX) said it has launched new &quot;live&quot; shipment tracking and rate quote features as enhancements of its internet services at BAXWorld.com.</p>
<p>The company said the new shipment tracking feature offers customers the ability to track shipments anywhere in the world, provide shipment history and proof of delivery information. - Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel +44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017</p>
</text>
